<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: '500 • Sunucu Hatası' }) %>
    <style>
        .error-card {
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 48px 32px;
        }
        .error-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            background: var(--danger-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--danger-border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 36px;
        }
        .error-pill {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--danger-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--danger-border);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: var(--danger);
            margin: 18px 0 28px;
            max-width: 100%;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <main class="container">
        <div class="card error-card">
            <div class="error-icon">🛡️⚡</div>
            <h1 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--danger); margin-bottom: 8px;">
                500 • Sunucu Hatası
            </h1>
            <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
                İşleminiz gerçekleştirilirken sunucuda beklenmedik bir durum oluştu.<br>
                <strong>5xx Guardian Middleware</strong> hatayı yakaladı, <code>logs/error.logs</code> dosyasına kaydetti ve sistem çökmesini engelledi.
            </p>

            <div class="error-pill">
                [<%= typeof method !== 'undefined' ? method : 'GET' %>] <%= typeof url !== 'undefined' ? url : '' %> &bull; <%= typeof errorMessage !== 'undefined' ? errorMessage : "Internal Server Error" %>
            </div>

            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Ana Sayfaya Dön</a>
                <a href="javascript:location.reload()" class="btn btn-secondary">🔄 Yeniden Dene</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
